Solver: SCIP (pyscipopt)
- Import: `from pyscipopt import Model`
- Create model: `model = Model("problem")`
- Variable types: `model.addVar(vtype="C")` for continuous, `"I"` for integer, `"B"` for binary
- Add constraint: `model.addCons(...)`
- Set objective: `model.setObjective(expr, "minimize")` or `"maximize"`
- Solve: `model.optimize()`
- Check status: `model.getStatus() == "optimal"`
- Get objective value: `model.getObjVal()`
